### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = votre_token_ici

### 1. LOGIN - Obtenir un token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "votre_username",
  "password": "votre_password"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.access);
    client.log("Token: " + response.body.access);
%}

### 2. GET PROFILE - Récupérer les infos du profil
GET {{baseUrl}}/account/firm/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. UPDATE PROFILE (JSON) - Mettre à jour les infos texte
PUT {{baseUrl}}/account/firm/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company_name": "Ma Nouvelle Entreprise",
  "address": "123 Nouvelle Adresse",
  "phone_number": "+33123456789",
  "first_name": "Nouveau",
  "last_name": "Nom"
}

### 4. UPLOAD LOGO (Multipart) - Tester l'upload du logo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/account/firm/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="company_logo"; filename="logo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./chemin/vers/votre/logo.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 5. UPLOAD LOGO Alternative - Avec chemin absolu
PUT {{baseUrl}}/account/firm/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="company_logo"; filename="test-logo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< C:/Users/VotreNom/Images/test-logo.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 6. TEST WITH CURL COMMAND (Alternative)
# Dans votre terminal :
# curl -X PUT "http://localhost:8000/api/account/firm/profile/" \
#   -H "Authorization: Bearer {{token}}" \
#   -F "company_logo=@./chemin/vers/logo.png"

### 7. TEST ERREUR - Sans fichier
PUT {{baseUrl}}/account/firm/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="company_name"

Entreprise Test
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 8. DELETE LOGO - Supprimer le logo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/account/firm/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company_logo": null
}

### 9. TEST ENDPOINT DÉDIÉ (si vous créez un endpoint spécial logo)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/account/firm/logo/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="company_logo"; filename="logo-test.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test-logo.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--